  "question": {
    "text": "The increasing order of the acidity of the following carboxylic acids is:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/RV1BGUAchTdYKCipMgMlIzqB3qyOirq2r5S08derjvk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
